This project intentionally follows and may directly port generic automation
implementation ideas and code from:

- March7thAssistant
  Upstream: https://github.com/moesnow/March7thAssistant
  Source revision used for the initial port planning:
  b43effef32afc2c32e090c13cb04fdd2f5227551
  License: GNU General Public License version 3

Porting boundary:

- In scope: reusable Windows automation infrastructure such as Unity window
  lookup, client-area screenshots, input backend abstraction, template/OCR
  element finding, screen graph routing, and task orchestration structure.
- Out of scope: March7thAssistant game assets, Honkai Star Rail screen
  definitions, launcher/updater UI, cloud game integrations, and game-specific
  task behavior.

Foundation Galactic Frontier templates, profile data, screen definitions, and
workflow tasks are project-local work for FoundationAssistant.
